# Local `npm run dev` only. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
# Cloudflare account login is `npx wrangler login`, not this file.
# Production Worker secrets: `npx wrangler secret put` — see
# docs/deployment.md and docs/voice.md#turn-on-the-pocket-voice.
MAILBOX_SECRET=dev-mailbox-secret-change-me
SESSION_SECRET=dev-session-secret-change-me
# Loopback only. Mock Ada + ?sample= scenes. Ignored on workers.dev.
PENDANT_DEV=1

# Optional. Kit's pocket voice on hold-to-talk (POST /api/tts).
# Same GCP project as the OAuth client. Enable Cloud Text-to-Speech,
# then an API key restricted to that API. Without it, /api/tts is 404
# and a spoken turn is read on screen only.
# GOOGLE_TTS_API_KEY=
# Optional. Default is already en-US-Chirp3-HD-Leda (lib/tts/http.ts).
# Loopback can set it here; workers.dev uses a wrangler var, not a secret.
# TTS_VOICE=en-US-Chirp3-HD-Leda
# Pocket voice flag. Unset follows the key (no key = no header mic).
# VOICE=off hides the mic even with a key. VOICE=on shows it without a key
# (dictate only; /api/tts is still 404 until GOOGLE_TTS_API_KEY is set).
# VOICE=off
